<section id="real">
  <h2>4. The same algorithm on secp256k1</h2>
  <p>Ethereum uses <span class="math">y² = x³ + 7</span> over a 256-bit prime. Only the field changes, so the identical double-and-add code applies (here with JavaScript <code>BigInt</code>). The base point and order are the published constants.</p>
